    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900279000
    Collect 1 of 900280000

Requires (player level >= 75 and player is karus and quest 759 is completed) or (player level >= 75 and player is elmorad and quest 760 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "hahaha, we're doing good. Let's go back to Bros."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here now. Good job."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Give me the sealed documents.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [14Devil] Leraje and [38Devil] Halphas."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here now. Good job."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Give me the sealed documents.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [14Devil] Leraje and [38Devil] Halphas."

On in_progress
    Say "Where did you place the seal?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With the sealed document you'll be sealed forever with the soul."

On completed
    Say "It's about time that the heads of the Devils are coming out. Defeat [Devil26] Bune, [Devil50] Furcas, [Devil67] Amdusias."
